{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_online_rotation_flow", "label": "Online-Rotations-Ablauf (5 Schritte)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Null Downtime, alte Daten durchgaengig lesbar: neuen Key als active, alten als retired, Sweep, Rollback-Fenster (~7 Tage, weil Backups noch den alten Key referenzieren koennen), dann retired entfernen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_masterkeyring", "label": "MasterKeyRing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_unique_key_version", "label": "Jede Version kommt genau einmal vor", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Byte des Payload-Manifests traegt die Version, mehr hat ein Leser nicht. Ohne die Pruefung loest der Lookup eine Kollision ueber die Reihenfolge auf (active zuerst), Payloads unter dem aelteren Key werden mit dem neueren entschluesselt und scheitern an einem Auth-Tag-Fehler, der die Ursache nicht nennt. Einen Key zu promoten ohne ihn umzunummerieren reicht dafuer aus."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_version_budget_255", "label": "255 ist kein Lebenszeit-Budget", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die Zahl begrenzt, wie viele Versionen gleichzeitig in einem Bestand leben, nicht wie oft rotiert werden darf. Ein breiteres Versionsfeld gibt es bewusst nicht, weil der Sweep die einzige Situation, in der es helfen wuerde, ohnehin aufloest. Ab Version 240 warnt die Registrierung."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_reencryptobjectstorage", "label": "reEncryptObjectStorage (Re-Encryption-Sweep)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Idempotent und fortsetzbar: ein Objekt auf der active-Version wird ohne Write uebersprungen (Header-Fast-Path). Per-Objekt-Fehler werden nicht verschluckt - der Sweep stoppt beim ersten, damit ein halb umgeschriebener Korpus nicht still entsteht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_reencryptresult", "label": "ReEncryptResult (scanned / rewrote / skipped*)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die Zaehler sind die Wahrheit - es gibt keinen separaten 'Stragglers auflisten'-Helper. Ein zweiter Lauf mit rewrote === 0 bestaetigt den Abschluss."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_inmemoryreencryptprogressstore", "label": "InMemoryReEncryptProgressStore", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fuer Millionen-Objekt-Stores, damit ein abgestuerzter Sweep nahe der Abbruchstelle fortsetzt statt von vorn zu scannen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_verifykeyringcompleteness", "label": "Keyring-Vollstaendigkeits-Vorabpruefung", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sampelt die ersten verschluesselten Objekte und verweigert den Start, wenn eine Key-Version fehlt - faengt 'Operator hat den retired-Key zu frueh entfernt' ab, BEVOR ein Mid-Sweep-Decrypt-Fehler den Korpus halb umgeschrieben zuruecklaesst. Sichert nur den Start, nicht spaetere eigene Keyring-Aenderungen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_newinfo_context_rotation", "label": "HKDF-Kontext rotieren (newInfo)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Kontext steht nicht im Body-Manifest, der Sweep kann einen umgeschriebenen Body also nicht am Header erkennen. Solange newInfo abweicht, ist der Versions-Fast-Path abgeschaltet und jedes Objekt wird entschluesselt - ohne das wuerde eine reine Kontext-Rotation alles als skipped-current melden und nichts aendern."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_skip_partial_rotation", "label": "Teilrotation mit `skip` (Ausschluss, nicht Filter)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_objectstorageconcurrencyerror", "label": "ObjectStorageConcurrencyError beim Sweep-CAS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Sweep schreibt mit Compare-and-Set auf dem ETag; hat die App zuerst geschrieben, bricht er ab - erneut laufen lassen, das frisch geschriebene Objekt ist bereits aktuell."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_online_rotation_flow", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_reencryptobjectstorage", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_online_rotation_flow", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_masterkeyring", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_unique_key_version", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_masterkeyring", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_version_budget_255", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_unique_key_version", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_version_budget_255", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_reencryptobjectstorage", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_reencryptobjectstorage", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_reencryptresult", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_reencryptobjectstorage", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_inmemoryreencryptprogressstore", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_verifykeyringcompleteness", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_reencryptobjectstorage", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_newinfo_context_rotation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_object_storage_key_rotation_reencryptobjectstorage", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/object-storage/key-rotation.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}